  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns an integer that is the total <a href="http://community.secondlife.com/t5/English-Knowledge-Base/Calculating-land-impact/ta-p/974163" target="_blank">land impact</a> of objects on the parcel at <b>pos</b> of the given <b>category</b></p>
</p>
